Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: retain the downstream connection-done probe target

The MSM wrapper installs a functional kretprobe on this callback by name.
ThinLTO inlines its only call in the minimal configuration, leaving that
probe unable to register. Keep a callable body for the downstream hook.

--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
@@ -4009,7 +4009,7 @@
 	dwc3_writel(dwc->regs, DWC3_DCFG, reg);
 }
 
-static void dwc3_gadget_conndone_interrupt(struct dwc3 *dwc)
+static noinline void dwc3_gadget_conndone_interrupt(struct dwc3 *dwc)
 {
 	struct dwc3_ep		*dep;
 	int			ret;
